### AOEM Bitcash Bot & Balance Monitoring API Testing (.http)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7000/api

### 1. Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:7000/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Check Bitcash Wallet Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/bitcash/balance
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Sync Bitcash Balance with Portal
POST {{baseUrl}}/bitcash/balance/sync
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Get Bitcash Balance Transaction Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/bitcash/ledger
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Execute Automated Top-up (Auto OTP Sandbox Mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/topup/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "5250140737488366145",
  "server": "Empire#239",
  "pack": "99+109 Coin",
  "priceJpy": 146,
  "autoOtp": true
}

### 6. Execute Automated Top-up (Manual OTP Mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/topup/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "5250140737488366145",
  "server": "Empire#239",
  "pack": "99+109 Coin",
  "priceJpy": 146,
  "autoOtp": false
}

### 7. Get All Bot Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/topup/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Submit OTP for a Waiting Job
POST {{baseUrl}}/topup/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "job-123456789",
  "otp": "151550"
}

### 9. List All Top-Up Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Get Order by ID (with Slip details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-AOEM-1092
Content-Type: application/json
